283
00:20:58.584 --> 00:21:02.829
Decision, Score every COD-eligible order for RTO risk.

284
00:21:03.109 --> 00:21:13.968
Offer plain COD below 12%, COD with OTP or IVR confirmation from 12% to 40%, and prepaid only above 40%.

285
00:21:14.248 --> 00:21:16.552
Review thresholds monthly per region.

286
00:21:16.832 --> 00:21:29.909
Related ADRs, ADR-I02 to 1 time sync for deal unlocks; ADR-I02 to 2 household-level deal limits; ADR-I02 to 3 payload budgets per screen.

